<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42028" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rūpes</span></b> , is (collat. form
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rūpa</span></b> ,
		ae, <i><span class="en">App. M. 6, p. 72</span></i>
		Hildebr. min.; cf. <i><span class="en">Gloss. Isid. p.
			693</span></i>),f.
		rumpo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a rock</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ex magnis rupibus nactus planitiem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Caes.
					B. C. 1, 70</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cum (oppidum) ex omnibus in circuitu partibus
					altissimas rupes despectusque haberet,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. B.
					G. 2, 29</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">Liv. 32, 4</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">and with this cf.: inter saxa rupesque,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					21, 40</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ex rupe Tarpeiā,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 7,
					10</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Parnasia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					E. 6, 29</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aëria,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. G.
					4, 508</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ardua,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. F.
					5, 293</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id. P. 1, 8, 51</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cavae,</span>”
				<i>caverns</i>, <i>grottos</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					G. 3, 253</span></i>
			; so, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ima (Sibyllae),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. A.
					3, 443</span></i>
			.—Of <i>a cliff</i>, <i><span class="en">Verg. A.
				10, 693</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Luc. 5, 514</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Val. Fl. 3,
				108</span></i>; <i><span class="en">4,
			637</span></i>; cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">personantibus et respondentibus inter se
					rupibus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Just.
					24, 6, 8</span></i>
			.</div>
